747
00:44:25,935 --> 00:44:27,311
Together with Mr. Nam, right?

748
00:44:27,937 --> 00:44:29,272
Yes, you do know.

749
00:44:29,772 --> 00:44:32,817
Hearing about the Pyeong-buk Gwan
renewal from you is interesting.

750
00:44:33,276 --> 00:44:35,610
Well, Yi-gyeong,

751
00:44:35,611 --> 00:44:38,738
