793
00:46:59,422 --> 00:47:01,215
I feel terrible saying this,

794
00:47:02,508 --> 00:47:05,761
but I hope Seon doesn't go to prison.

795
00:47:06,846 --> 00:47:07,847
This...

796
00:47:08,848 --> 00:47:10,057
From the start, it was Hwal-sung

797
00:47:10,558 --> 00:47:11,642
