798
00:47:16,480 --> 00:47:17,273
Oh.

799
00:47:18,941 --> 00:47:20,025
That's interesting.

800
00:47:20,568 --> 00:47:21,485
Yi-gyeong,

801
00:47:22,069 --> 00:47:23,571
