819
00:49:48,591 --> 00:49:50,091
OH NO...

820
00:49:50,092 --> 00:49:52,218
It's okay. I'll get into another school.

821
00:49:52,219 --> 00:49:54,095
Congratulations, Da-rae! That's awesome!

