827
00:51:59,221 --> 00:52:01,639
You can't drink beer
at convenience stores these days.

828
00:52:01,640 --> 00:52:02,599
Oh, really?

829
00:52:05,102 --> 00:52:06,937
We have some good liquor
at our real estate office.

830
00:52:07,730 --> 00:52:08,480
Let's go.

831
00:52:11,775 --> 00:52:12,693
Oh, okay.

832
00:52:18,907 --> 00:52:19,783
Yes.

833
00:52:28,834 --> 00:52:30,335
Yi-gyeong, I'm home.

834
00:52:36,383 --> 00:52:37,176
Yi-gyeong?

835
00:52:38,469 --> 00:52:39,720
Can you come
see me for a second?

836
00:52:41,597 --> 00:52:42,306
What?

837
00:52:43,307 --> 00:52:45,266
I'm tired, so I'll just

838
00:52:45,267 --> 00:52:46,225
go wash up first.

839
00:52:46,226 --> 00:52:47,435
No.

840
00:52:47,436 --> 00:52:48,395
Come see me now.

841
00:52:55,360 --> 00:52:56,445
Where have you been?

842
00:52:59,156 --> 00:53:00,406
I was meeting someone.

843
00:53:00,407 --> 00:53:02,159
I asked where you went.

844
00:53:05,871 --> 00:53:09,499
I went to a downtown development event.

845
00:53:09,500 --> 00:53:10,292
Why?

846
00:53:11,835 --> 00:53:13,504
Did you go to sell the Pyeong-buk Gwan?

847
00:53:14,797 --> 00:53:16,632
Does someone actually listen to you?

848
00:53:20,219 --> 00:53:21,386
Jeez.

849
00:53:23,013 --> 00:53:24,181
You really

850
00:53:24,848 --> 00:53:26,391
underestimate people.

851
00:53:27,518 --> 00:53:28,936
I have my own thoughts too.

852
00:53:29,144 --> 00:53:31,479
Just sitting still is helping.

853
00:53:31,480 --> 00:53:33,440
Just stay still like a rock.

854
00:53:36,401 --> 00:53:38,904
I should have just stayed a vegetable.

855
00:53:40,072 --> 00:53:41,990
I woke up for no reason.

856
00:53:42,741 --> 00:53:43,909
I'm sorry.

857
00:53:46,870 --> 00:53:48,746
But you're really

858
00:53:48,747 --> 00:53:50,249
are something.

859
00:53:50,707 --> 00:53:52,459
You used to hate your mom.

860
00:53:53,752 --> 00:53:55,754
You even said the cold noodles were trash,

861
00:53:56,505 --> 00:53:57,840
so why the sudden change?

862
00:53:59,216 --> 00:54:00,133
Are you trying to be a good daughter?

863
00:54:07,850 --> 00:54:08,767
Gosh.

864
00:54:13,313 --> 00:54:14,565
Did you cheat on me with Seon?

865
00:54:16,191 --> 00:54:17,234
Hey.

866
00:54:18,694 --> 00:54:20,903
We just ran into each other by chance.

867
00:54:20,904 --> 00:54:21,947
What about the kidnapping?

868
00:54:23,949 --> 00:54:25,075
What are you talking about?

869
00:54:25,742 --> 00:54:27,494
Hey.

870
00:54:33,792 --> 00:54:36,169
It was better when you were a vegetable.

871
00:54:40,883 --> 00:54:43,885
Fine, I'll explain everything, okay?

872
00:54:43,886 --> 00:54:45,469
Jeez!

873
00:54:45,470 --> 00:54:46,722
Just get out of this house.

874
00:54:49,349 --> 00:54:50,850
What are you talking about,
Yi-gyeong?

875
00:54:50,851 --> 00:54:52,311
I said get out!

876
00:55:06,700 --> 00:55:09,369
KIM GYUN

877
00:55:14,041 --> 00:55:15,541
But you don't know this,
do you?

878
00:55:15,542 --> 00:55:17,502
Su-jong's connection to Gyun's death.

879
00:55:21,632 --> 00:55:23,299
Huh?

880
00:55:23,300 --> 00:55:24,092
Da-rae.

881
00:55:37,481 --> 00:55:39,273
I WANT TO BE ALONE

882
00:55:39,274 --> 00:55:41,568
WHAT'S WRONG?

883
00:55:48,992 --> 00:55:50,243
What's going on with her?

884
00:55:53,121 --> 00:55:53,747
I SAID I WANT TO BE ALONE

885
00:56:13,517 --> 00:56:14,266
The cafe owner on the first floor
was the one who got blamed

886
00:56:14,267 --> 00:56:15,267
Mr. Kim's building
was bought with Mr. Nam

887
00:56:15,268 --> 00:56:16,103
YOU KILLED ME

888
00:56:19,856 --> 00:56:23,402
You killed me, my mother-in-law,
and the cafe owner too

889
00:56:42,295 --> 00:56:45,132
YOU SLEPT WITH SEON

890
00:56:49,428 --> 00:56:51,304
KIM GYUN

891
00:57:04,526 --> 00:57:05,318
Get in.

892
00:57:13,910 --> 00:57:15,203
Why are you trying to be noisy?

893
00:57:15,787 --> 00:57:17,080
So hurry up and get in.

894
00:57:23,670 --> 00:57:26,047
Legally,
when getting a divorce,

895
00:57:26,048 --> 00:57:28,424
The one who cheated is at fault, right?

896
00:57:28,425 --> 00:57:30,134
That means when dividing assets,

897
00:57:30,135 --> 00:57:32,762
it's advantageous for the person
who didn't cheat.

898
00:57:32,763 --> 00:57:33,805
I didn't cheat.

899
00:57:34,598 --> 00:57:37,350
But Seon did cheat.

900
00:57:38,810 --> 00:57:39,770
What's this?

901
00:57:41,271 --> 00:57:42,981
Su-jong is preparing to divorce you.

902
00:57:45,525 --> 00:57:46,193
What?

903
00:57:46,777 --> 00:57:48,403
You're going to get blindsided.

904
00:58:11,593 --> 00:58:12,718
What's going on?

905
00:58:12,719 --> 00:58:14,386
Something must have
happened with your lady.

906
00:58:14,387 --> 00:58:18,141
♪ The wind, the wind,
the wind is blowing ♪

907
00:58:18,517 --> 00:58:19,935
Gosh.

908
00:58:23,396 --> 00:58:24,439
Hee-ju.

909
00:58:35,408 --> 00:58:36,201
Hee-ju?

910
00:58:37,327 --> 00:58:38,328
Come on.

911
00:58:44,709 --> 00:58:45,710
Hee-ju.

912
00:58:46,545 --> 00:58:48,171
What time is it?

913
00:58:51,424 --> 00:58:52,259
Hee-ju.

914
00:58:53,385 --> 00:58:54,302
Wake up.

915
00:58:55,887 --> 00:58:56,555
Hee-ju...

916
00:59:05,272 --> 00:59:06,106
What's going on?

917
00:59:07,774 --> 00:59:09,693
SEON

918
00:59:28,962 --> 00:59:30,172
Oh, Hee-ju...

919
00:59:55,947 --> 00:59:57,324
MAD CONCRETE DREAMS

920
00:59:59,075 --> 01:00:01,202
I really didn't do anything.
I swear.

921
01:00:01,203 --> 01:00:03,746
- Da-rae got accepted?
- You didn't know?

922
01:00:03,747 --> 01:00:05,290
She got the acceptance email last night.

923
01:00:05,540 --> 01:00:08,542
No to forced development
and property theft!

924
01:00:08,543 --> 01:00:09,793
We oppose! We oppose!

925
01:00:09,794 --> 01:00:12,504
People are starting to notice.

926
01:00:12,505 --> 01:00:14,173
Let's wrap this up...

927
01:00:14,174 --> 01:00:16,550
Da-rae texted me. What is this?

928
01:00:16,551 --> 01:00:19,012
He plotted
to take over Seyoon Building...

929
01:00:19,137 --> 01:00:20,304
Da-rae.

930
01:00:20,305 --> 01:00:21,805
You need
to prepare for divorce too.

931
01:00:21,806 --> 01:00:23,766
Su-jong has committed some crimes.

932
01:00:23,767 --> 01:00:25,768
We need to get a solid grip on this.

933
01:00:25,769 --> 01:00:26,645
I'll help you.

